### Create an order via REST (StreamBridge)
POST http://localhost:8112/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-001",
  "customerId": "CUST-A",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "shouldFail": false
}

### Create an order that should fail processing
POST http://localhost:8112/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-FAIL",
  "customerId": "CUST-B",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "shouldFail": true
}
